config
.
. Phase 6b leitzentrale bridge: reads sponge_configd's "config" broadcast
. and emits the leitzentrale_enabled ROM consumed by the subsystem's
. fader_config (rom_filter) and sculpt_manager.
.
. configd broadcasts: <config><key name="leitzentrale.enabled" value="true"/>...</config>
. This bridge extracts that key and produces: <leitzentrale enabled="yes"/> (or "no").
.
. "yes"/"no" (not "true"/"false") because that is what the Sculpt
. fader_config (rom_filter has_value: yes) and sculpt_manager expect —
. see genode/repos/gems/sculpt/option/sculpt and leitzentrale/default.
.
+ input leitzentrale | rom: lz_config | node: config
  + node key | type: key | attribute: name | value: leitzentrale.enabled
  + attribute value
+ output | node: leitzentrale
  + if
    + has_value | input: leitzentrale | value: true
    + then | + attribute enabled | value: yes
    + else | + attribute enabled | value: no
-
